

%BOLD=1.%TC=1.Hotkeys:%BOLD=0.%TC=7.

Hotkeys allow you to issue commands at various points before a menu
has been fully displayed by intercepting the first key-press. If hotkeys
are turned off then the RETURN key must be pressed after typing in the
command sequence.

